arn More &gt;</a></strong></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gtJxSR cOjBdh pf-465_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-eIceNc cJLiOo pf-466_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">IAPD/IPRA Soaring to New Heights Conference — January&nbsp;23 - 24, 2025</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-eIceNc cJLiOo pf-468_ pf-heading-1-h3">Hyatt Regency – Chicago, IL</h3><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-470_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">The IAPD/IPRA Soaring to New Heights Conference holds the unique distinction of being the largest state park and recreation conference in the nation. The conference brings together thousands of professionals, Commissioners, and elected officials from around the state for three exciting days of quality educational programming, networking, and professional development. Visit Russo at Booth #234.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.ilparksconference.com/" target="_blank"><b><a href="https://www.ilparksconference.com/" target="_blank">Learn More &gt;</a></b></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gtJxSR cOjBdh pf-472_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-eIceNc cJLiOo pf-473_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Lawn Care Application Timing — January&nbsp;15, 2025</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-eIceNc cJLiOo pf-475_ pf-heading-1-h3">Russo: New Berlin, WI — 11:00AM Social &amp; Lunch, 1:00PM Seminar Starts</h3><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-477_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><strong>Have questions about applying plant health care products like fertilizers, chemicals, or seed?&nbsp;</strong>Join us for this engaging seminar with Larry Vogel (Spring Valley), Patrick Bastron (PBI Gordon), and Rob Osier (Russo Plant&nbsp;Health Care Manager). They'll address common concerns and share practical tips to boost your confiden