ic City Center in Nashville, TN<br></b><br>The NATDA Trailer Show is the perfect place to learn more about our diverse selection of in-stock trailers and parts. <a href="https://www.natda.org/trailer-show" target="_self">More Info &gt;</a></p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-imwrwD LlXSA pf-1060_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-eIceNc cJLiOo pf-1064_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Tree Climbing From Ground to Crown— August 26</b></h3><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-1066_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Russo Power Equipment - Elgin - 8am to 3pm<br></b><br>Receive 6 CEUs &amp; learn about the best tree climbing techniques and modern climbing gear from arbor expert Beau Nagan.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-imwrwD LlXSA pf-1068_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-eIceNc cJLiOo pf-1072_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Lunch &amp; Learn: Building Plant Health with Soil Science— August 24</b></h3><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-1074_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">A 2nd chance to earn 3 CEUs while learning how to expand your business and keep your clients' plants happy &amp; healthy! Sponsored by ArborJet &amp; Ecologel.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-imwrwD LlXSA pf-1076_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-eIceNc cJLiOo pf-1080_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>IAA Annual Golf Outing— August 19</b></h3><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-1082_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Salt Creek Golf Course in Wood Dale, IL<br><br>12pm - Lunch<br>1pm - Shot gun start<br>6pm - Dinner<br></b><br>The Illinois Arborist Association Golf Outing is always a fan favorite, so bring your game face and make sure you come to play!</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-imwrwD LlXSA pf-1084_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-eIceNc cJLiOo pf-1088_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Lunch &amp; Learn: Building Plant Health with Soil Science— August 10</b></h3><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-1090_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Earn 3 CEUs while learning strategies to diversify your business and keep plants happy &amp; healthy! Sponsored by ArborJet &amp; Ecologel.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-imwrwD LlXSA pf-1092_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-eIceNc cJLiOo pf-1096_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>ILCA Fire &amp; Ice Summer Field &amp; Snow Day— August 4</b></h3><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-1098_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Cantigny Park in Wheaton, IL<br></b><br>We’re going to be one of over 100 exhibitors at ILCA’s brand-new Fire &amp; Ice summer field and snow day, and we can’t wait to see you! <a href="https://ilca.net/ilca-events/fire-and-ice/" target="_self">More Info &gt;</a></p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-imwrwD LlXSA pf-1100_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-eIceNc cJLiOo pf-1104_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>IAA Tree Climbing Championship — June 25</b></h3><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-1106_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Shiloh Park in Zion, IL<br><br>7am - Competitor gear check
8:15am - Competition preliminary events begin</b><br><br>We’re heading to the IAA Tree Climbing Championship for a day full of competition, fun, and outdoor activities. Our certified arborist, Dan, will be judging the competition and we'll have a booth at the fair. Stop by to learn more about all things arbor! <a href="https://illinoisarborist.org/2022-illinois-tree-climbing-championship/" target="_self">More Info &gt;</a></p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-imwrwD LlXSA pf-1108_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-eIceNc cJLiOo pf-1112_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Live Online Auction — June 15</b></h3><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-1114_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Russo Elgin </b>- 1001 N Randall Rd, Elgin, IL 60123, USA<b><br><br>Consign By:</b> 5/21   |   <b>Preview Day:</b> 6/14</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-imwrwD LlXSA pf-1116_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-eIceNc cJLiOo pf-1120_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Chainsaw Safety Seminar — June 10</b></h3><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-1122_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Russo Hainesville </b>- 39 East Belvidere Road, Hainesville, IL 60030, USA<br><br>Earn 1.5 ISA CEUs while learning about the best chainsaw safety practices from a certified chainsaw technician. We’ll cover and discuss all the basics from chainsaw starting, usage, handling, maintenance, and more.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-imwrwD LlXSA pf-1124_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-eIceNc cJLiOo pf-1128_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>APWA Chicago Expo &amp; Roadeo — May 18 &amp; 19</b></h3><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-1130_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Odeum Expo Center in Villa Park, IL</b><br><br>While attending the APWA Expo, stop by our booth, say hi, and we’ll fill you in on all of the exciting news and equipment we have in stock! <a href="http://chicago.apwa.net/Content/Chapters/chicago.apwa.net/Documents/2022%20APWA%20CMC%20Expo%20Exhibitor%20Sponsor%20Information(3).pdf" target="_self">More Info &gt;</a></p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-imwrwD LlXSA pf-1132_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-eIceNc cJLiOo pf-1136_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Live&nbsp;In-Person Auction — April 9</b></h3><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-1138_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Auction begins at 8:00am at Russo:</b> Hainesville   |   <b>Preview Day:</b> 04/08, Hainesville<br><br>After a long break due to Covid, we're excited to announce the return of our in-person auction! Plan to spend the day bidding on an assortment of high-quality used equipment.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-imwrwD LlXSA pf-1140_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-eIceNc cJLiOo pf-1144_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Russo Spring Open House</b></h3><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-1146_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We’re happy to announce the long-awaited return of the Russo Open House! Spring Open House features representatives from the most prominent companies in the industry putting on demonstrations and informing customers of the newest products on the market. Save the date for a day full of fun, raffles, giveaways, and more.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-imwrwD LlXSA pf-1148_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-eIceNc cJLiOo pf-1152_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Live&nbsp;Online Auction — March 16</b></h3><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-1154_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>No Consignment   |   Preview Day:</b> 03/15, Elgin</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-imwrwD LlXSA pf-1156_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-eIceNc cJLiOo pf-1160_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Service Hiring Event at Schiller Park — March 10 &amp; 11</b></h3><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-1162_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>In-person Interviews &amp; On-the-spot Offers<br></b><br>Meet the staff, see the space, have some food, and have an in-person interview with potential offers! We're hiring multiple people for 3 positions: Service Porters, Service Mechanics, &amp; Lead Service Advisor. All mechanic levels from apprentice to master are welcome to apply! Visit <a href="/pages/careers" target="_self">RussoPower.com/careers</a>&nbsp;7 to see all job opportunities!</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><script>
